[offset:00:00:53]
[00:54.35][01:36.53][02:28.55][03:12.63][03:50.72][04:34.60]
[00:10.35]We've spent a lifetime apart
[00:12.73]So I keep a record in my heart
[00:14.90]Of all the waiting in the wings I've done
[00:17.89]A wretched little tale I've spun
[00:20.09]Because it's everyday I'm waiting for more
[00:23.04]A message from the opposite shore
[00:24.97]Some coded beeps that I can never unwind
[00:28.05]And I'm not even sure that you mind
[00:30.37]It's a repetition every day
[00:33.01]Just waiting on the words to say
[00:35.29]God I'm desperate to hear your voice
[00:37.97]I wish I even had a damn choice
[00:40.19]'Cause when I stare across the gap between our hearts
[00:44.99]I wanna meet you in the middle!
[00:50.10]I wanna meet you in the middle
[00:56.85][02:32.81]Baby, do you know what you wanna hear?
[00:59.27][02:35.16]'Cause you can say the word, make it all so clear
