[01:16.58][01:26.54][02:52.56][03:02.68][04:14.69][04:24.64]Dream together, we can dream together
[01:18.63][02:54.49][04:16.68]We can fantasize about the fairer weather
[01:21.15][02:57.17][04:19.32]If we stay together, we can stay together
[01:23.70][01:33.74][02:59.67][03:09.76][04:21.76][04:31.84]Hold each other closer like we're birds of a feather
[01:28.69][03:04.66][04:26.71]Baby, ain't nobody gonna live forever
[01:31.17][03:07.24][04:29.36]So we stay together, we should stay together
[01:42.31](Baby, do you know what you wanna hear?)
[01:44.64]('Cause you can say the word, make it all so clear)
[01:46.46]I've been wanting for a shot that's sharp
[01:48.81]So I paint a target on my heart
[01:51.22]Hoping bow and arrow strikes me true
[01:53.93]So I can throw it back to you
[01:56.16]But baby, aim is all I got to show
[01:58.96]An imitation cupid's bow
[02:01.24]And I'm a fool without a firing zone
